        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oren",
        "text": "I can feel your seething anger."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oren",
        "text": "You're angry that I violated the purity of your faith. That proves you're thinking as a Lateran."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oren",
        "text": "Your mission is to bring the Sanctilaminium Ambrosii back to Laterano, and to help the lost Lateran kin there. My mission is to preserve what makes Laterano, Laterano."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Oren",
        "text": "Set your sentimentality aside, Lemuen. We're in agreement here."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_925_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Enough with your sophistry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "Did you learn it from the Victorian nobles, or Columbian merchants, Legatus Oren?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen",
        "text": "I said it, the sudden appearance of beasts will frighten wanderers. I'm not going to stand by and watch a massacre happen."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
