    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "I am Executor Federico of the Laterano Notarial Hall. That was a warning shot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Cardinal Aide Lemuen, Legatus Oren, and Technician Serpilia of the Sixth Tribunal. I command you to cease your pointless altercation at once."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "I see no need to understand your positions or mediate your conflict."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "The mission remains incomplete. Newly emerged factors continue to present a risk of escalation. This monastery needs order."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "If there is no contradiction between you, yet conflict remains unresolved; if empathy is not enough to prevent a community from disintegrating..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Then I will be order."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "That warning shot was also intended for the special forces outside. Lateran troops will not enter the Sanctilaminium Ambrosii without my express authorization."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "You were the one who deployed them, Oren. You will restrain them. Order them to pull back one kilometer and stand by."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Lemuen and Serpilia. The two of you have been in contact with the Sankta and Sarkaz populations here. You will reassure them and prevent the situation from escalating."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "Meet me in the chapel once you have finished your task. Richele has uncovered a lead and is following it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Federico",
        "text": "I will find the one responsible for this situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
